{"3905740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vindilis", "steam_appid": 3905740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dark, short-form, souls-like indie game, you play as Fury, the last hope againtst the Omniscient in this dark celtic fantasy setting..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/extras/034a3642ade96dae31e67df330f75006.avif?t=1765297719\" width=630 height=148 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the desolate island of Vindilis.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Omniscient, lord of the island, has descended into madness and unleashed the four plagues upon the people who rebelled against him. Play as Fury and embark on an epic quest for vengeance across the island of Vindilis, accompanied by your sword and your sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Hand Drawn Animations<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/extras/136cbce42d4c4f5cdf187e2b24d78264.poster.avif?t=1765297719\" width=600 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/extras/136cbce42d4c4f5cdf187e2b24d78264.webm?t=1765297719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/extras/136cbce42d4c4f5cdf187e2b24d78264.mp4?t=1765297719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vindilis is a classic 2D action-adventure game set on a desolate island. Traverse five hand-drawn levels, defeat your enemies, and face powerful bosses to save Vindilis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/extras/91965fea3f1a18c485a4a75b45ac32fa.poster.avif?t=1765297719\" width=726 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/extras/91965fea3f1a18c485a4a75b45ac32fa.webm?t=1765297719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/extras/91965fea3f1a18c485a4a75b45ac32fa.mp4?t=1765297719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic 2D action game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay inspired by Souls-like games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art direction in a unique pencil-style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 levels to explore and 5 bosses to face</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short and intense experience (approximately 1 hour of gameplay)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/extras/6ba113fd889499c7d0b7e4f472067e43.avif?t=1765297719\" width=630 height=148 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dark, short-form, souls-like indie game, you play as Fury, the last hope againtst the Omniscient in this dark celtic fantasy setting..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/extras/034a3642ade96dae31e67df330f75006.avif?t=1765297719\" width=630 height=148 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the desolate island of Vindilis.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Omniscient, lord of the island, has descended into madness and unleashed the four plagues upon the peop